[sub_resource type="Resource" id="GateCondition_has_evidence"]
script = ExtResource("2_condition")
all_of = Array[StringName]([&"has_evidence"])

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="InventoryItemState_evidence"]
script = ExtResource("3_state")
condition = SubResource("GateCondition_has_evidence")
label = "Cell & Idol"
description = "A spent Siren containment cell with the Crooked Idol stashed inside."
action_input = &"open_evidence"
action_key_hint = "E"
action_kind = &"evidence"
evidence_title = "Recovered Cell & Idol"
evidence_image = ExtResource("4_image")
evidence_description = "[b]Recovered Cell & Idol[/b]

Fred recovered a spent Siren Containment Cell from the laundry basin under the chute mouth. The genuine Crooked Idol was wedged inside the cell housing.

The discharge end is exactly the right size for the wound. The back-pressure valve is popped — only happens when the nozzle is obstructed by a solid object during discharge. The Manual Override lever is flipped.

This is the manual-purge signature from Theo's field book. The murder weapon was not a ghost. Someone on the equipment side used the cell as a point-blank discharge weapon."

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_definition")
item_id = &"evidence"
states = [SubResource("InventoryItemState_evidence")]
